-generate control objective based on request content','Pending further completion by AI or manual review','Pending completion',NULL,NULL,NULL,'MEDIUM','V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:00','2026-07-27 23:40:00'),(34,4,'REQ-49','REQ000049','The organization demonstrates a commitment to integrity and ethical values\nCurrent employee handbook (updated within the last 12 months)','CC 1.1','Security','Establishes Standards of Conduct: The expectations of the board of directors and senior management concerning integirty and ethical values are defined in the organization\'s standards of conduct and understood at all levels of the organization, as wel as by outsourced service providers and business partners.','DRAFT','AI_GENERATED',1,49,NULL,'Auto-generate control objective based on request content','Pending further completion by AI or manual review','Pending completion',NULL,NULL,NULL,'MEDIUM','V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:00','2026-07-27 23:40:00'),(35,4,'REQ-50','REQ000050','The organization demonstrates a commitment to integrity and ethical values\nCurrent Code of Conduct policy (only if not included as part of the employee handbook)','CC 1.1','Security','Establishes Standards of Conduct: The expectations of the board of directors and senior management concerning integirty and ethical values are defined in the organization\'s standards of conduct and understood at all levels of the organization, as wel as by outsourced service providers and business partners.','DRAFT','AI_GENERATED',1,50,NULL,'Auto-generate control objective based on request content','Pending further completion by AI or manual review','Pending completion',NULL,NULL,NULL,'MEDIUM','V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:00','2026-07-27 23:40:00'),(36,4,'REQ-51','REQ000051','The organization demonstrates a commitment to integrity and ethical values\nHandbook acknowledgement form (only if not included as part of the employee handbook)','CC 1.1','Security','Establishes Standards of Conduct: The expectations of the board of directors and senior management concerning integirty and ethical values are defined in the organization\'s standards of conduct and understood at all levels of the organization, as wel as by outsourced service providers and business partners.','DRAFT','AI_GENERATED',1,51,NULL,'Auto-generate control objective based on request content','Pending further completion by AI or manual review','Pending completion',NULL,NULL,NULL,'MEDIUM','V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:00','2026-07-27 23:40:00'),(37,4,'REQ-52','REQ000052','The organization demonstrates a commitment to integrity and ethical values\nBlank employee performance review or evaluation form','CC 1.1','Security','Evaluates Adherence to Standards of Conduct: Processes are in place to evaluate individual and team performance against the organization\'s expected standards of conduct.','DRAFT','AI_GENERATED',1,52,NULL,'Auto-generate control objective based on request content','Pending further completion by AI or manual review','Pending completion',NULL,NULL,NULL,'MEDIUM','V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:00','2026-07-27 23:40:00'),(38,4,'REQ-53','REQ000053','The organization demonstrates a commitment to integrity and ethical values\nDisciplinary policies and procedures (only if not included as part of the employee handbook)','CC 1.1','Security','Addresses Deviations in a Timely Manner: Deviations from expected standards of conduct are identified and remedied in a timely and consistent manner.','DRAFT','AI_GENERATED',1,53,NULL,'Auto-generate control objective based on request content','Pending further completion by AI or manual review','Pending completion',NULL,NULL,NULL,'MEDIUM','V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:00','2026-07-27 23:40:00'),(39,4,'REQ-54','REQ000054','The organization demonstrates a commitment to integrity and ethical values\nBlank contractor or vendor employee agreement','CC 1.1','Security','Considers Contractors and Vendor Employees in Demonstrating its Commitment: Management and the board of directors consider the use of contractors and vendor employees in its processes for establishing standards of conduct, evaluating adherence to standards, and addressing deviations in a timely manner.','DRAFT','AI_GENERATED',1,54,NULL,'Auto-generate control objective based on request content','Pending further completion by AI or manual review','Pending completion',NULL,NULL,NULL,'MEDIUM','V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:00','2026-07-27 23:40:00'),(40,4,'REQ-55','REQ000055','The organization demonstrates a commitment to integrity and ethical values\nContractor or vendor employee new hire procedures','CC 1.1','Security','Considers Contractors and Vendor Employees in Demonstrating its Commitment: Management and the board of directors consider the use of contractors and vendor employees in its processes for establishing standards of conduct, evaluating adherence to standards, and addressing deviations in a timely manner.','DRAFT','AI_GENERATED',1,55,NULL,'Auto-generate control objective based on request content','Pending further completion by AI or manual review','Pending completion',NULL,NULL,NULL,'MEDIUM','V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:00','2026-07-27 23:40:00'),(41,4,'REQ-56','REQ000056','The board of directors demonstrates independence from management and exercises oversight of the development and performance of internal controls.\nAgendas and meeting minutes from 3 executive and/or board meetings held during the previous 6 months, with sensitve data redacted','CC 1.2','Security','Establishes Oversight Responsibilities: The board of directors identifies and accepts its oversight responsibilities in relation to established requirements and expectations.','DRAFT','AI_GENERATED',1,56,NULL,'Auto-generate control objective based on request content','Pending further completion by AI or manual review','Pending completion',NULL,NULL,NULL,'MEDIUM','V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:00','2026-07-27 23:40:00'),(42,4,'REQ-57','REQ000057','The board of directors demonstrates independence from management and exercises oversight of the development and performance of internal controls.\nBoard of Director bylaws and/or charter','CC 1.2','Security','Accepts Relevant Expertise: The board of directors defines, maintains, and periodically evaluates the skills and expertise needed among its members to enable them to ask probing questions of senior management and take commensurate action.','DRAFT','AI_GENERATED',1,57,NULL,'Auto-generate control objective based on request content','Pending further completion by AI or manual review','Pending completion',NULL,NULL,NULL,'MEDIUM','V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:00','2026-07-27 23:40:00'),(43,4,'REQ-58','REQ000058','The board of directors demonstrates independence from management and exercises oversight of the development and performance of internal controls.\nA list of all members of the board of directors and biographies, preferably from a published source','CC 1.2','Security','Operates Independently: The board of directors has sufficient members who are independent from management and objective in evaluations and decision making.','DRAFT','AI_GENERATED',1,58,NULL,'Auto-generate control objective based on request content','Pending further completion by AI or manual review','Pending completion',NULL,NULL,NULL,'MEDIUM','V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:00','2026-07-27 23:40:00'),(44,4,'REQ-59','REQ000059','The board of directors demonstrates independence from management and exercises oversight of the development and performance of internal controls.\nListing of organization\'s committees reporting to the board of directors','CC 1.2','Security','Supplements Board Expertise: The board of directors supplements its expertise relevant to security, availability, processing integrity, confidentiality, and privacy, as needed, through the use of a subcommittee and/or consultants.','DRAFT','AI_GENERATED',1,59,NULL,'Auto-generate control objective based on request content','Pending further completion by AI or manual review','Pending completion',NULL,NULL,NULL,'MEDIUM','V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:00','2026-07-27 23:40:00'),(45,4,'REQ-60','REQ000060','Management establishes, with board oversight, structures, reporting lines, and appropriate authorities and responsibilities in the pursuit of objectives.\nCurrent org chart with date of last revision (must have been updated within the last 12 months)','CC 1.3','Security','Considers All Structures of the Entity: Management and the board of directors consider the multiple structures used (including operating units, legal entities, geographic distribution, and outsourced service providers) to support the achievement of objectives.','DRAFT','AI_GENERATED',1,60,NULL,'Auto-generate control objective based on request content','Pending further completion by AI or manual review','Pending completion',NULL,NULL,NULL,'MEDIUM','V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:00','2026-07-27 23:40:00'),(46,4,'REQ-61','REQ000061','Management establishes, with board oversight, structures, reporting lines, and appropriate authorities and responsibilities in the pursuit of objectives.\nEvidence that management has reviewed the org chart','CC 1.3','Security','Establishes Reporting Lines: Management designs and evaluates lines of reporting for each entity structure to enable executiion of authorities and responsibilities and flow of information to manage the activities of the entity.','DRAFT','AI_GENERATED',1,61,NULL,'Auto-generate control objective based on request content','Pending further completion by AI or manual review','Pending completion',NULL,NULL,NULL,'MEDIUM','V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:00','2026-07-27 23:40:00'),(47,4,'REQ-62','REQ000062','Management establishes, with board oversight, structures, reporting lines, and appropriate authorities and responsibilities in the pursuit of objectives.\nSample of 5 current job descriptions','CC 1.3','Security','Defines, Assigns, and Limits Authorities and Responsibilities: Management and the board of directors delegate authority, define responsbilities, and use ap