ing for each entity structure to enable executiion of authorities and responsibilities and flow of information to manage the activities of the entity.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:00',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:00','2026-07-27 23:40:00'),(62,4,1,16,'REQ000062','CC 1.3','REQ000062','Management establishes, with board oversight, structures, reporting lines, and appropriate authorities and responsibilities in the pursuit of objectives.\nSample of 5 current job descriptions','Defines, Assigns, and Limits Authorities and Responsibilities: Management and the board of directors delegate authority, define responsbilities, and use appropriate processes and technology to assign responsibility and segregate duties as necessary at various levels of the organization.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:00',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:00','2026-07-27 23:40:00'),(63,4,1,17,'REQ000063','CC 1.3','REQ000063','Management establishes, with board oversight, structures, reporting lines, and appropriate authorities and responsibilities in the pursuit of objectives.\nPolicies or processes for updating job descriptions','Defines, Assigns, and Limits Authorities and Responsibilities: Management and the board of directors delegate authority, define responsbilities, and use appropriate processes and technology to assign responsibility and segregate duties as necessary at various levels of the organization.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:00',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:00','2026-07-27 23:40:00'),(64,4,1,18,'REQ000064','CC 1.3','REQ000064','Management establishes, with board oversight, structures, reporting lines, and appropriate authorities and responsibilities in the pursuit of objectives.\nWithin job descriptions, show any requirements relevant to security, availability, and confidentiality 