its system objectives to appropriate external users.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:00','2026-07-27 23:40:00'),(103,4,1,57,'REQ000103','CC 2.3','REQ000103','The organization communicates with external parties regarding matters that affect the function of internal controls.\nVendor management policy and/or procedures','Communicates System Responsibilities: External users with responsibility for designing, developing, implementing, operating, maintaining, and monitoring system controls receive communications about their responsibilities and have the information necessary to carry out those responsibilities.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:00','2026-07-27 23:40:00'),(104,4,1,58,'REQ000104','CC 2.3','REQ000104','The organization communicates with external parties regarding matters that affect the function of internal controls.\nPolicies and/or procedures for how customers report incidents, system failures, bugs, and other complaints.','Communicates Information on Reporting System Failures, Incidents, Concerns, and Other Matters: External users are provided with information on how to report systems failures, incidents, concerns, and other complaints to appropriate personnel.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:00','2026-07-27 23:40:00'),(105,4,1,59,'REQ000105','CC 3.1','REQ000105','The organization specifies objectives with sufficient clarity to enable the identification and assessment of risks relating to objectives.\nCurrent risk management policy and/or procedures','Reflects Management\'s Choices: Operations objectives reflect management\'s choices about structure, industry considerations, and performance of the organization.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-2