'The organization specifies objectives with sufficient clarity to enable the identification and assessment of risks relating to objectives.\nAccounting and/or finance operational procedures document','Complies With Applicable Accounting Standards: Financial reporting objectives are consistent with accounting principles suitable and available for that organization. The accounting principles selected are appropriate in the circumstances.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:00','2026-07-27 23:40:00'),(110,4,1,64,'REQ000110','CC 3.1','REQ000110','The organization specifies objectives with sufficient clarity to enable the identification and assessment of risks relating to objectives.\nExample meeting minutes and/or agenda utilized to discuss financial objectives, goals, or metrics','Considers Materiality: Management considers materiality in financial statement presentation.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:00','2026-07-27 23:40:00'),(111,4,1,65,'REQ000111','CC 3.1','REQ000111','The organization specifies objectives with sufficient clarity to enable the identification and assessment of risks relating to objectives.\nAccounting and/or finance operational procedures document','Reflects Organizational Activities: External reporting reflects the underlying transactions and events to show qualitative characteristics and assertions.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:00','2026-07-27 23:40:00'),(112,4,1,66,'REQ000112','CC 3.1','REQ000112','The organization specifies objectives with sufficient clarity to enable the identification and assessment of risks relating to objectives.\nAny regulatory or compliance requirements applicable to the organization','Complies With Externally Established Frameworks: Management establishes objectives consistent with laws and regulations or standards and frameworks of recognized external organizations.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:00','2026-07-27 23:40:00'),(113,4,1,67,'REQ000113','CC 3.1','REQ000113','The organization specifies objectives with sufficient clarity to enable the identification and assessment of risks relating to objectives.\nAccounting and/or finance operational procedures document','Considers the Required Level of Precision: Management reflects the required level of precision and accuracy suitable for user needs and based on criteria established by third parties in nonfinancial reporting.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:00','2026-07-27 23:40:00'),(114,4,1,68,'REQ000114','CC 3.1','REQ000114','The organization specifies objectives with sufficient clarity to enable the identification and assessment of risks relating to objectives.\nAccounting and/or finance operational procedures document','Reflects Organizational Activities: External reporting reflects the underlying transactions and events within a range of acceptable limits.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(115,4,1,69,'REQ000115','CC 3.1','REQ000115','The organization specifies objectives with sufficient clarity to enable the identification and assessment of risks relating to objectives.\nExample meeting minutes and/or agenda utilized to discuss financial objectives, goals, or metrics','Reflects Management\'s Choices: Internal reporting provides management with accurate and complete information regarding management\'s choices and information needed in managing the organization.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(116,4,1,70,'REQ000116','CC 3.1','REQ000116','The organization specifies objectives with sufficient clarity to enable the identification and assessment of risks relating to objectives.\nAccounting and/or finance operational procedures document','Considers the Required Level of Precision: Management reflects the required level of precision and accuracy suitable for user needs in nonfinancial reporting objectives and materiality within financial reporting objectives.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(117,4,1,71,'REQ000117','CC 3.1','REQ000117','The organization specifies objectives with sufficient clarity to enable the identification and assessment of risks relating to objectives.\nExample meeting minutes and/or agenda utilized to discuss financial objectives, goals, or metrics','Reflects Organizational Activities: Internal reporting reflects the underlying transactions and events within a range of acceptable limits.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(118,4,1,72,'REQ000118','CC 3.1','REQ000118','The organization specifies objectives with sufficient clarity to enable the identification and assessment of risks relating to objectives.\nAny regulatory or compliance requirements applicable to the organization','Reflects External Laws and Regulations: Laws and regulations establish minimum standards of conduct, which the organzization integrates into compliance objectives.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(119,4,1,73,'REQ000119','CC 3.1','REQ000119','The organization specifies objectives with sufficient clarity to enable the identification and assessment of risks relating to objectives.\nCurrent risk management policy and/or procedures','Considers Risk Tolerances: Management considers the acceptable levels of variation relative to the achievement of operational objectives.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(120,4,1,74,'REQ000120','CC 3.1','REQ000120','The organization specifies objectives with sufficient clarity to enable the identification and assessment of risks relating to objectives.\nInformation security policy','Establishes Sub-objectives to Support Objectives: Management identifies sub-objectives related to security, availability, processing integrity, confidentiality, and privacy to support the achievement of the organization\'s objectives related to reporting, operations, and compliance.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(121,4,1,75,'REQ000121','CC 3.2','REQ000121','The organization identifies risks to the achievement of its objectives across the organization and analyzes risks as a basis for determining how the risks should be managed.\nCurrent risk assessment policy and/or procedures','Includes Organizational, Subsidiary, Division, Operating Unit, and Functional Levels: The organization identifies and assesses risk at the organizational, subsidiary, division, operating unit, and functional levels relevant to the achievement of objectives.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(122,4,1,76,'REQ000122','CC 3.2','REQ000122','The organization identifies risks to the achievement of its objectives across the organization and analyzes risks as a basis for determining how the risks should be managed.\nCurrent risk assessment policy and/or procedures','Analyzes Internal and External Factors: Risk identification considers both internal and external factors and their impact on the achievement of objectives.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(123,4,1,77,'REQ000123','CC 3.2','REQ000123','The organization identifies risks to the achievement of its objectives across the organization and analyzes risks as a basis for determining how the risks should be managed.\nEvidence of management involvement in the risk assessment process (internal communications such as emails, memos, etc.)','Involves Appropriate Levels of Management: The organization puts into place effective risk assessment mechanisms that involve appropriate levels of management.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(124,4,1,78,'REQ000124','CC 3.2','REQ000124','The organization identifies risks to the achievement of its objectives across the organization and analyzes risks as a basis for determining how the risks should be managed.\nCurrent risk assessment policy and/or procedures','Estimates Significance of Risks Identified: Identified risks are analyzed through a process that includes estimating the potential significance of the risk.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(125,4,1,79,'REQ000125','CC 3.2','REQ000125','The organization identifies risks to the achievement of its objectives across the organization and analyzes risks as a basis for determining how the risks should be managed.\nCurrent risk assessment policy and/or procedures','Determines How to Respond to Risks: Risk assessment includes considering how the risk should be managed and whether to accept, avoid, reduce, or share the risk.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(126,4,1,80,'REQ000126','CC 3.2','REQ000126','The organization identifies risks to the achievement of its objectives across the organization and analyzes risks as a basis for determining how the risks should be managed.\nCurrent inventory of information assets','Identifies and Assesses Criticality of Information Assets and Identifies Threats and Vulnerabilities: The organization\'s risk identification and assessment process includes: \n1. Identifying information assets, including physical devices and systems, virtual devices, software, data and data flows, external information systems, and organizational roles\n2. Assessing the criticality of those information assets \n3. Identifying the threats to the assets from intentional (including malicious) and unintentional acts and environmental events\n4. Identifying vulnerabilities of the identified assets','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(127,4,1,81,'REQ000127','CC 3.2','REQ000127','The organization identifies risks to the achievement of its objectives across the organization and analyzes risks as a basis for determining how the risks should be managed.\nVulnerability scan or penetration test reports performed within the review period','Analyzes Threats and Vulnerabilities From Vendors, Business Partners, and Other Parties: The organization\'s risk assessment process includes analysis of potential threats and vulnerabilities arising from vendors providing goods and services, as well as threats and vulnerabilities arising from business partners, customers, and others with access to the organization\'s information systems.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(128,4,1,82,'REQ000128','CC 3.2','REQ000128','The organization identifies risks to the achievement of its objectives across the organization and analyzes risks as a basis for determining how the risks should be managed.\nDocumentation of risk assessment performed within the review period','Considers the Significance of the Risk: The orgnization\'s consideration of the potential significance of the identified risks includes: \n1. Determining the criticality of identified assets in meeting objectives\n2. Assessing the impact of identified threats and vulnerabilities in meeting objectives\n3. Assessing the likelihood of identified threats \n4. Determining the risk associated with assets based on asset criticality, threat impact, and likelihood','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(129,4,1,83,'REQ000129','CC 3.3','REQ000129','The organization considers the potential for fraud in assessing risks to the achievement of objectives.\nFraud assessment policy and/or process','Considers Various Types of Fraud: The assessment of fraud considers fraudulent reporting, possible loss of assets, and corruption resulting from the various ways that fraud and misconduct can occur.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(130,4,1,84,'REQ000130','CC 3.3','REQ000130','The organization considers the potential for fraud in assessing risks to the achievement of objectives.\nCurrent fraud assessment (conducted within the review period)','Assesses Incentives and Pressures: The assessment of fraud risks considers incentives and pressures.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(131,4,1,85,'REQ000131','CC 3.3','REQ000131','The organization considers the potential for fraud in assessing risks to the achievement of objectives.\nCurrent fraud assessment (conducted within the review period)','Assesses Opportunities: The assessment of fraud risk considers opportunities for unauthorized acquisition, use, or disposal of assets, altering the organization\'s reporting records, or committing other inappropriate acts.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(132,4,1,86,'REQ000132','CC 3.3','REQ000132','The organization considers the potential for fraud in assessing risks to the achievement of objectives.\nCurrent fraud assessment (conducted within the review period)','Assesses Attitudes and Rationalizations: The assessment of fraud risk considers how management and other personnel might engage in or justify inappropriate actions.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(133,4,1,87,'REQ000133','CC 3.3','REQ000133','The organization considers the potential for fraud in assessing risks to the achievement of objectives.\nCurrent fraud assessment (conducted within the review period)','Considers the Risks Related to the Use of IT and Access to Information: The assessment of fraud risks includes consideration of threats and vulnerabilities that arise specifically from the use of IT and access to information.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(134,4,1,88,'REQ000134','CC 3.4','REQ000134','The organization identifies and assesses changes that could significantly impact the system of internal controls.\nCurrent risk assessment (conducted within the review period)','Assesses Changes in the External Environment: The risk identification process considers changes to the regulatory, economic, and physical environment in which the organization operates.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(135,4,1,89,'REQ000135','CC 3.4','REQ000135','The organization identifies and assesses changes that could significantly impact the system of internal controls.\nCurrent risk assessment (conducted within the review period)','Assesses Changes in the Business Model: The organization considers the potential impacts of new business lines, dramatically altered compositions of existing business lines, acquired or divested business operations on the system of internal control, rapid growth, changing reliance on foreign geographies, and new technologies.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(136,4,1,90,'REQ000136','CC 3.4','REQ000136','The organization identifies and assesses changes that could significantly impact the system of internal controls.\nCurrent risk assessment (conducted within the review period)','Assesses Changes in Leadership: The organization considers changes in management and respective attitudes and philosophies on the system of internal control.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(137,4,1,91,'REQ000137','CC 3.4','REQ000137','The organization identifies and assesses changes that could significantly impact the system of internal controls.\nCurrent risk assessment (conducted within the review period)','Assess Changes in Systems and Technology: The risk identification process considers changes arising from changes in the organization\'s systems and changes in the technology environment.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(138,4,1,92,'REQ000138','CC 3.4','REQ000138','The organization identifies and assesses changes that could significantly impact the system of internal controls.\nAny external reviews performed within the last 12 months, i.e., ISO 27001 or PCI DSS certifications, audit reports','Assess Changes in Vendor and Business Partner Relationships: The risk identification process considers changes in vendor and business partner relationships.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(139,4,1,93,'REQ000139','CC 4.1','REQ000139','The organization selects, develops, and performs ongoing and/or separate evaluations to ascertain whether the components of internal control are present and functioning.\nIncident response policy and/or process, security breach identification and notification policies and/or process, monitoring policies and/or procedures','Considers a Mix of Ongoing and Separate Evaluations: Management includes a balance of ongoing and separate evaluations.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(140,4,1,94,'REQ000140','CC 4.1','REQ000140','The organization selects, develops, and performs ongoing and/or separate evaluations to ascertain whether the components of internal control are present and functioning.\nScreenshot of incident management system ticketing, including name and current version of software; list of incident tickets generated during the review period','Considers Rate of Change: Management considers the rate of change in business and business processes when selecting and developing ongoing and separate evaluations.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(141,4,1,95,'REQ000141','CC 4.1','REQ000141','The organization selects, develops, and performs ongoing and/or separate evaluations to ascertain whether the components of internal control are present and functioning.\nScreenshot of monitoring system configuration, including name and current version of software; system description for monitoring system','Establishes Baseline Understanding: The design and current state of an internal control system are used to establish a baseline for ongoing and separate evaluations.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(142,4,1,96,'REQ000142','CC 4.1','REQ000142','The organization selects, develops, and performs ongoing and/or separate evaluations to ascertain whether the components of internal control are present and functioning.\nEmail or screenshot of notification generated by monitoring system; list of personnel who receive alerts','Uses Knowledgeable Personnel: Evaluators performing ongoing and separate evaluations have sufficient knowledge to understand what is being evaluated.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(143,4,1,97,'REQ000143','CC 4.1','REQ000143','The organization selects, develops, and performs ongoing and/or separate evaluations to ascertain whether the components of internal control are present and functioning.\nIncident response policy and monitoring policies and/or processes','Integrates With Business Processes: Ongoing evaluations are built into the business processes and adjust to changing conditions.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(144,4,1,98,'REQ000144','CC 4.1','REQ000144','The organization selects, develops, and performs ongoing and/or separate evaluations to ascertain whether the components of internal control are present and functioning.\nPolicy and/or process for adjusting scope and frequency of evaluations','Adjusts Scope and Frequency: Management varies the scope and frequency of separate evaluations depending on risk.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(145,4,1,99,'REQ000145','CC 4.1','REQ000145','The organization selects, develops, and performs ongoing and/or separate evaluations to ascertain whether the components of internal control are present and functioning.\nMonitoring policies and/or processes','Objectively Evaluates: Separate evaluations are performed periodically to provide objective feedback.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(146,4,1,100,'REQ000146','CC 4.1','REQ000146','The organization selects, develops, and performs ongoing and/or separate evaluations to ascertain whether the components of internal control are present and functioning.\nAny external evaluations performed within the last 12 months, i.e., ISO 27001 or PCI DSS certifications, audit reports','Considers Different Types of Ongoing and Separate Evaluations: Management uses a variety of different types of ongoing and separate evaluations, including penetration testing, independent certification made against established specifications (for example, ISO certifications), and internal audit assessments.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(147,4,1,101,'REQ000147','CC 4.2','REQ000147','The organization evaluates and communicates internal control deficiencies in a timely manner to those parties responsible for taking corrective action, including senior management and the board of directors, as appropriate.\nMeeting agendas, minutes, or emails documenting that management and the board of directors assessed evaluation results','Assesses Results: Management and the board of directors, as appropriate, assess results of ongoing and separate evaluations.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(148,4,1,102,'REQ000148','CC 4.2','REQ000148','The organization evaluates and communicates internal control deficiencies in a timely manner to those parties responsible for taking corrective action, including senior management and the board of directors, as appropriate.\nScreenshot of incident management system ticketing, including name and current version of software','Communicates Deficiencies: Deficiencies are communicated to parties responsible for taking corrective action and to senior management and the board of directors, as appropriate.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(149,4,1,103,'REQ000149','CC 4.2','REQ000149','The organization evaluates and communicates internal control deficiencies in a timely manner to those parties responsible for taking corrective action, including senior management and the board of directors, as appropriate.\nList of incident tickets generated in the review period','Monitors Corrective Action: Management tracks whether deficiencies are remedied on a timely basis.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(150,4,1,104,'REQ000150','CC 5.1','REQ000150','The organization selects and develops control activities that contribute to the mitigation of risks to the achievement of objectives to acceptable levels.\nCurrent risk assessment','Integrates With Risk Assessment: Control activities help ensure that risk responses that address and mitigate risks are carried out.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:01',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(151,4,1,105,'REQ000151','CC 5.1','REQ000151','The organization selects and develops control activities that contribute to the mitigation of risks to the achievement of objectives to acceptable levels.\nCurrent risk assessment','Considers Organization-Specific Factors: Management considers how the environment, complexity, nature, and scope of its operations, as well as the specific characteristics of its organization, affect the selection and development of control activities.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(152,4,1,106,'REQ000152','CC 5.1','REQ000152','The organization selects and develops control activities that contribute to the mitigation of risks to the achievement of objectives to acceptable levels.\nCurrent risk assessment','Determines Relevant Business Processes: Management determines which relevant business processes require control activities.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(153,4,1,107,'REQ000153','CC 5.1','REQ000153','The organization selects and develops control activities that contribute to the mitigation of risks to the achievement of objectives to acceptable levels.\nCurrent risk assessment','Evaluates a Mix of Data Submitted Types: Control activities include a range and variety of controls and may include a balance of approaches to mitigate risks, considering both manual and automated controls, and preventive and detective controls.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(154,4,1,108,'REQ000154','CC 5.1','REQ000154','The organization selects and develops control activities that contribute to the mitigation of risks to the achievement of objectives to acceptable levels.\nCurrent risk assessment','Considers at What Level Activities Are Applied: Management considers control activities at various levels in the organization.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(155,4,1,109,'REQ000155','CC 5.1','REQ000155','The organization selects and develops control activities that contribute to the mitigation of risks to the achievement of objectives to acceptable levels.\nCurrent org chart with date of last revision (must have been updated within the last 12 months)','Addresses Segregation of Duties: Management segregates incompatible duties, and where such segregation is not practical, management selects and develops alternative control activities.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(156,4,1,110,'REQ000156','CC 5.2','REQ000156','The entity also selects and develops general control activities over technology to support the achievement of objectives.\nPlans for annual risk assessment, internal/external audit for the calendar year','Determines Dependency Between the Use of Technology in Business Processes and Technology General Controls: Management understands and determines the dependency and linkage between business processes, automated control activities, and technology general controls.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(157,4,1,111,'REQ000157','CC 5.2','REQ000157','The entity also selects and develops general control activities over technology to support the achievement of objectives.\nPolicies and procedures for infrastructure deployment, development, and approval','Establishes Relevant Technology Infrastructure Control Activities: Management selects and develops control activities over the technology infrastructure, which are designed and implemented to help ensure the completeness, accuracy, and availability of technology processing.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(158,4,1,112,'REQ000158','CC 5.2','REQ000158','The entity also selects and develops general control activities over technology to support the achievement of objectives.\nCurrent access control policy and/or processes','Establishes Relevant Security Management Process Controls Activities: Management selects and develops control activities that are designed and implemented to restrict technology access rights to authorized users commensurate with their job responsibilities and to protect the organization\'s assets from external threats.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(159,4,1,113,'REQ000159','CC 5.2','REQ000159','The entity also selects and develops general control activities over technology to support the achievement of objectives.\nCurrent service acquisition and maintenance policy and/or processes','Establishes Relevant Technology Acquisition, Development, and Maintenance Process Control Activities: Management selects and develops control activities over the acquisition, development, and maintenance of technology and its infrastructure to achieve management’s objectives.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(160,4,1,114,'REQ000160','CC 5.3','REQ000160','The organization deploys control activities through policies that establish what is expected and in procedures that put policies into action.\nPolicies and/or processes that secure the system and information assets','Establishes Policies and Procedures to Support Deployment of Management ‘s Directives: Management establishes control activities that are built into business processes and employees’ day-to-day activities through policies establishing what is expected and relevant procedures specifying actions.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(161,4,1,115,'REQ000161','CC 5.3','REQ000161','The organization deploys control activities through policies that establish what is expected and in procedures that put policies into action.\nBlank employee confidentiality agreement or NDA','Establishes Responsibility and Accountability for Executing Policies and Procedures: Management establishes responsibility and accountability for control activities with management (or other designated personnel) of the business unit or function in which the relevant risks reside.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(162,4,1,116,'REQ000162','CC 5.3','REQ000162','The organization deploys control activities through policies that establish what is expected and in procedures that put policies into action.\nSet of information security policies and procedures','Performs in a Timely Manner: Responsible personnel perform control activities in a timely manner as defined by the policies and procedures.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(163,4,1,117,'REQ000163','CC 5.3','REQ000163','The organization deploys control activities through policies that establish what is expected and in procedures that put policies into action.\nSet of information security policies and procedures','Takes Corrective Action: Responsible personnel investigate and act on matters identified as a result of executing control activities.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(164,4,1,118,'REQ000164','CC 5.3','REQ000164','The organization deploys control activities through policies that establish what is expected and in procedures that put policies into action.\nCurrent hiring policy and/or processes, including a new hire checklist','Performs Using Competent Personnel: Competent personnel with sufficient authority perform control activities with diligence and continuing focus.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(165,4,1,119,'REQ000165','CC 5.3','REQ000165','The organization deploys control activities through policies that establish what is expected and in procedures that put policies into action.\nAnnual review of security policies (dated within the last 12 months)','Reassesses Policies and Procedures: Management periodically reviews control activities to determine their continued relevance and refreshes them when necessary.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(166,4,1,120,'REQ000166','CC 6.1','REQ000166','The organization implements logical access security software, infrastructure, and architectures over protected information assets to protect them from security events to meet the organization\'s objectives.\nCurrent inventory of information assets','Identifies and Manages the Inventory of Information Assets: The organization identifies, inventories, classifies, and manages information assets.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(167,4,1,121,'REQ000167','CC 6.1','REQ000167','The organization implements logical access security software, infrastructure, and architectures over protected information assets to protect them from security events to meet the organization\'s objectives.\nScreenshot of login process showing multi-factor authentication enabled','Restricts  Logical Access: Logical access to information assets, including hardware, data (at-rest, during processing, or in transmission), software, administrative authorities, mobile devices, output, and offline system components is restricted through the use of access control software and rule sets.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(168,4,1,122,'REQ000168','CC 6.1','REQ000168','The organization implements logical access security software, infrastructure, and architectures over protected information assets to protect them from security events to meet the organization\'s objectives.\nScreenshot of system authentication settings for in-scope servers, databases, and production applications','Identifies and Authenticates Users: Persons, infrastructure and software are identified and authenticated prior to accessing information assets, whether locally or remotely.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(169,4,1,123,'REQ000169','CC 6.1','REQ000169','The organization implements logical access security software, infrastructure, and architectures over protected information assets to protect them from security events to meet the organization\'s objectives.\nCurrent diagram of in-scope physical and local networks, including all firewalls for production servers (IP addresses partially redacted)','Considers Network Segmentation: Network segmentation permits unrelated portions of the organization\'s information system to be isolated from each other.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(170,4,1,124,'REQ000170','CC 6.1','REQ000170','The organization implements logical access security software, infrastructure, and architectures over protected information assets to protect them from security events to meet the organization\'s objectives.\nScreenshot of current intrusion detection system configuration','Manages Points of Access: Points of access by outside entities and the types of data that flow through the points of access are identified, inventoried, and managed. The types of individuals and systems using each point of access are identified, documented, and managed.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(171,4,1,125,'REQ000171','CC 6.1','REQ000171','The organization implements logical access security software, infrastructure, and architectures over protected information assets to protect them from security events to meet the organization\'s objectives.\nScreenshot of current firewall rules and configurations','Restricts Access to Information Assets: Combinations of data classification, separate data structures, port restrictions, access protocol restrictions, user identification, and digital certificates are used to establish access control rules for information assets.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(172,4,1,126,'REQ000172','CC 6.1','REQ000172','The organization implements logical access security software, infrastructure, and architectures over protected information assets to protect them from security events to meet the organization\'s objectives.\nSet of information security policies/procedures relevant to logical access control and authentication requirements','Manages Identification and Authentication: Identification and authentication requirements are established, documented, and managed for individuals and systems accessing organization information, infrastructure, and software.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(173,4,1,127,'REQ000173','CC 6.1','REQ000173','The organization implements logical access security software, infrastructure, and architectures over protected information assets to protect them from security events to meet the organization\'s objectives.\nSet of information security policies/procedures relevant to logical access control and authentication requirements','Manages Credentials for Infrastructure and Software: New internal and external infrastructure and software  are registered, authorized, and documented prior to being granted access credentials and implemented on the network or access point. Credentials are removed and access is disabled when access is no longer required or the infrastructure and software are no longer in use.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(174,4,1,128,'REQ000174','CC 6.1','REQ000174','The organization implements logical access security software, infrastructure, and architectures over protected information assets to protect them from security events to meet the organization\'s objectives.\nCurrent encryption configuration for data-at-rest and databases','Uses Encryption to Protect Data: The organization uses encryption to supplement other measures used to protect data-at-rest, when such protections are deemed appropriate based on assessed risk.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(175,4,1,129,'REQ000175','CC 6.1','REQ000175','The organization implements logical access security software, infrastructure, and architectures over protected information assets to protect them from security events to meet the organization\'s objectives.\nCurrent encryption key management policies and/or processes','Protects Encryption Keys: Processes are in place to protect encryption keys during generation, storage, use, and destruction.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(176,4,1,130,'REQ000176','CC 6.2','REQ000176','Prior to issuing system credentials and granting system access, the organization registers and authorizes new internal and external users whose access is administered by the organization. For those users whose access is administered by the organization, user system credentials are removed when user access is no longer authorized.\nCurrent access control policies and/or processes','Controls Access Credentials to Protected Assets: Information asset access credentials are created based on an authorization from the system\'s asset owner or authorized custodian.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(177,4,1,131,'REQ000177','CC 6.2','REQ000177','Prior to issuing system credentials and granting system access, the organization registers and authorizes new internal and external users whose access is administered by the organization. For those users whose access is administered by the organization, user system credentials are removed when user access is no longer authorized.\nCurrent termination policy and/or processes, including an offboarding checklist','Removes Access to Protected Assets When Appropriate: Processes are in place to remove credential access when an individual no longer requires such access.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(178,4,1,132,'REQ000178','CC 6.2','REQ000178','Prior to issuing system credentials and granting system access, the organization registers and authorizes new internal and external users whose access is administered by the organization. For those users whose access is administered by the organization, user system credentials are removed when user access is no longer authorized.\nResults of user access review performed within the review period','Reviews Appropriateness of Access Credentials: The appropriateness of access credentials is reviewed on a periodic basis for unnecessary and inappropriate individuals with credentials.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(179,4,1,133,'REQ000179','CC 6.3','REQ000179','The organization authorizes, modifies, or removes access to data, software, functions, and other protected information assets based on roles, responsibilities, or the system design and changes, giving consideration to the concepts of least privilege and segregation of duties, to meet the organization\'s objectives.\nCurrent access control policies and/or processes','Creates or Modifies Access to Protected Information Assets: Processes are in place to create or modify access to protected information assets based on authorization  from the asset’s owner.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(180,4,1,134,'REQ000180','CC 6.3','REQ000180','The organization authorizes, modifies, or removes access to data, software, functions, and other protected information assets based on roles, responsibilities, or the system design and changes, giving consideration to the concepts of least privilege and segregation of duties, to meet the organization\'s objectives.\nCurrent termination policy and/or processes, including an offboarding checklist','Removes Access to Protected Information Assets: Processes are in place to remove access to protected information assets when an individual no longer requires access.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(181,4,1,135,'REQ000181','CC 6.3','REQ000181','The organization authorizes, modifies, or removes access to data, software, functions, and other protected information assets based on roles, responsibilities, or the system design and changes, giving consideration to the concepts of least privilege and segregation of duties, to meet the organization\'s objectives.\nCurrent access control policies and/or processes','Uses Role-Based Access Controls: Role-based access control is utilized to support segregation of incompatible functions.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(182,4,1,136,'REQ000182','CC 6.4','REQ000182','The organization restricts physical access to facilities and protected information assets (for example, data center facilities,  back-up media storage, and other sensitive locations) to authorized personnel to meet the organization\'s objectives.\nCurrent physical access policies and/or processes','Creates or Modifies Physical Access: Processes are in place to create or modify physical access to facilities such as data centers, office spaces, and work areas, based on authorization from the system\'s asset owner.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(183,4,1,137,'REQ000183','CC 6.4','REQ000183','The organization restricts physical access to facilities and protected information assets (for example, data center facilities,  back-up media storage, and other sensitive locations) to authorized personnel to meet the organization\'s objectives.\nCurrent termination policy and/or processes, including an offboarding checklist','Removes Physical Access: Processes are in place to remove access to physical resources when an individual no longer requires access.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(184,4,1,138,'REQ000184','CC 6.4','REQ000184','The organization restricts physical access to facilities and protected information assets (for example, data center facilities,  back-up media storage, and other sensitive locations) to authorized personnel to meet the organization\'s objectives.\nResults of physical access review performed within the review period','Reviews Physical Access: Processes are in place to periodically review physical access to ensure consistency with job responsibilities.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:01','2026-07-27 23:40:01'),(185,4,1,139,'REQ000185','CC 6.5','REQ000185','The organization discontinues logical and physical protections over physical assets only after the ability to read or recover data and software from those assets has been diminished and is no longer required to meet the organization\'s objectives.\nCurrent data retention and disposal policy','Identifies Data and Software for Disposal: Procedures are in place to identify data and software stored on equipment to be disp