ces\n2. Use of intelligence sources to identify newly discovered threats and vulnerabilities \n3. Logging of unusual system activities','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:02','2026-07-27 23:40:02'),(212,4,1,166,'REQ000212','CC 7.2','REQ000212','The organization monitors system components and the operation of those components for anomalies that are indicative of malicious acts, natural disasters, and errors affecting the organization\'s ability to meet its objectives; anomalies are analyzed to determine whether they represent security events.\nCurrent incident response policy; or security breach identification, notification, and escalation policies and/or processes','Designs Detection Measures: Detection measures are designed to identify anomalies that could result from actual or attempted: \n1. Compromise of physical barriers \n2. Unauthorized actions of authorized personnel \n3. Use of compromised identification and authentication credentials \n4. Unauthorized access from outside the system boundaries \n5. Compromise of authorized external parties\n6. Implementation or connection of unauthorized hardware and software','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:02','2026-07-27 23:40:02'),(213,4,1,167,'REQ000213','CC 7.2','REQ000213','The organization monitors system components and the operation of those components for anomalies that are indicative of malicious acts, natural disasters, and errors affecting the organization\'s ability to meet its objectives; anomalies are analyzed to determine whether they represent security events.\nCurrent intrusion detection system (IDS), including product make and model or software version','Implements Filters to Analyze Anomalies: Management has implemented procedures to filter, summarize, and analyze anomalies to identify security events.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:02','2026-07-27 23:40:02'),(214,4,1,168,'REQ000214','CC 7.2','REQ000214','The organization monitors system components and the operation of those components for anomalies that are indicative of malicious acts, natural disasters, and errors affecting the organization\'s ability to meet its objectives; anomalies are analyzed to determine whether they represent security events.\nSystem generated alerts, notificatons, or emails from the review period','Monitors Detection Tools for Effective Operation: Management has implemented processes to monitor the effectiveness of detection tools.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:02','2026-07-27 23:40:02'),(215,4,1,169,'REQ000215','CC 7.3','REQ000215','The organization evaluates security events to determine whether they could or have resulted in a failure of the organization to meet its objectives (security incidents) and, if so, takes actions to prevent or address such failures.\nCurrent incident response policy and/or processes','Responds to Security Incidents: Procedures are in place for responding to security incidents and evaluating the effectiveness of those policies and procedures on a periodic basis.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:02',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:02','2026-07-27 23:40:02'),(216,4,1,170,'REQ000216','CC 7.3','REQ000216','The organization evaluates security events to determine whether they could or have resulted in a failure of the organization to meet its objectives (security incidents) and, if so, takes actions to prevent or address such failures.\nScreenshot of incident management system ticketing, including name and current version of tickeitng software','Communicates and Reviews Detected Security Events: Detected security