6-07-27 23:40:03',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:02','2026-07-27 23:40:02'),(254,4,1,208,'REQ000254','CC 8.1','REQ000254','The organization authorizes, designs, develops or acquires, configures, documents, tests, approves, and implements changes to infrastructure, data, software, and procedures to meet its objectives.\nCurrent network diagram or separate virtual isntances showing separate environments for production, testing, and development','Protects Confidential Information: The organization protects confidential information during system design, development, testing, implementation, and change processes to meet the organization\'s objectives related to confidentiality.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:03',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:02','2026-07-27 23:40:02'),(255,4,1,209,'REQ000255','CC 8.1','REQ000255','The organization authorizes, designs, develops or acquires, configures, documents, tests, approves, and implements changes to infrastructure, data, software, and procedures to meet its objectives.\nScreenshot or system-generated list of user and admins with access to development, testing, and production environments.','Protects Personal Information: The organization protects personal information during system design, development, testing, implementation, and change processes to meet the organization\'s objectives related to privacy.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:03',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:02','2026-07-27 23:40:02'),(256,4,1,210,'REQ000256','CC 9.1','REQ000256','The organization identifies, selects, and develops risk mitigation activities for risks arising from potential business disruptions.\nCurrent risk assessment','Considers Mitigation of Risks of Business Disruption: Risk mitigation activities include the development of planned policies, procedures, communications, and alternative processing solutions to respond to, mitigate, and recover from security events that disrupt business operations. Those policies and procedures include monitoring processes and information and communications to meet the organization\'s objectives during response, mitigation, and recovery efforts.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:03',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:02','2026-07-27 23:40:02'),(257,4,1,211,'REQ000257','CC 9.1','REQ000257','The organization identifies, selects, and develops risk mitigation activities for risks arising from potential business disruptions.\nCurrent insurance policies','Considers the Use of Insurance to Mitigate Financial Impact Risks: The risk management activities consider the use of insurance to offset the financial impact of loss events that would otherwise impair the ability of the organization to meet its objectives.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:03',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:02','2026-07-27 23:40:02'),(258,4,1,212,'REQ000258','CC 9.2','REQ000258','The organization assesses and manages risks associated with vendors and business partners.\nCurrent vendor management policies and/or processes','Establishes Requirements for Vendor and Business Partner Engagements: The organization establishes specific requirements for a vendor and business partner engagement that includes: \n1. Scope of services and product specifications\n2. Roles and responsibilities\n3. Compliance requirements\n4. Service levels','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:03',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:02','2026-07-27 23:40:02'),(259,4,1,213,'REQ000259','CC 9.2','REQ000259','The organization assesses and manages risks associated with vendors and business partners.\nCurrent vendor risk assessment, conducted within the review period','Assesses Vendor and Business Partner Risks: The organization assesses, on a periodic basis, the risks that vendors and business partners represent to the achievement of the organization\'s objectives.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:03',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:02','2026-07-27 23:40:02'),(260,4,1,214,'REQ000260','CC 9.2','REQ000260','The organization assesses and manages risks associated with vendors and business partners.\nList of authorized personnel assigned to manage vendor risks','Assigns Responsibility and Accountability for Managing Vendors and Business Partners: The organization assigns responsibility and accountability for the management of risks associated with vendors and business partners.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:03',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:02','2026-07-27 23:40:02'),(261,4,1,215,'REQ000261','CC 9.2','REQ000261','The organization assesses and manages risks associated with vendors and business partners.\nCurrent vendor management policies and/or processes','Establishes Communication Protocols for Vendors and Business Partners: The organization establishes communication and resolution protocols for service or product issues related to vendors and business partners.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:03',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:02','2026-07-27 23:40:02'),(262,4,1,216,'REQ000262','CC 9.2','REQ000262','The organization assesses and manages risks associated with vendors and business partners.\nCurrent vendor management policies and/or processes','Establishes Exception Handling Procedures From Vendors and Business Partners: The organization establishes exception handling procedures for service or product issues related to vendors and business partners.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:03',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:02','2026-07-27 23:40:02'),(263,4,1,217,'REQ000263','CC 9.2','REQ000263','The organization assesses and manages risks associated with vendors and business partners.\nThird-party attestation reports for all key vendors (SOC 2, ISO 27001, PCI DSS) and management reviews of the reports','Assesses Vendor and Business Partner Performance: The organization periodically assesses the performance of vendors and business partners.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:03',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:02','2026-07-27 23:40:02'),(264,4,1,218,'REQ000264','CC 9.2','REQ000264','The organization assesses and manages risks associated with vendors and business partners.\nCurrent vendor management policies and/or processes','Implements Procedures for Addressing Issues Identified During Vendor and Business Partner Assessments: The organization implements procedures for addressing issues identified with vendor and business partner relationships.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:03',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:02','2026-07-27 23:40:02'),(265,4,1,219,'REQ000265','CC 9.2','REQ000265','The organization assesses and manages risks associated with vendors and business partners.\nCurrent vendor management policies and/or processes','Implements Procedures for Terminating Vendor and Business Partner Relationships: The organization implements procedures for terminating vendor and business partner relationships.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:03',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:02','2026-07-27 23:40:02'),(266,4,1,220,'REQ000266','CC 9.2','REQ000266','The organization assesses and manages risks associated with vendors and business partners.\n5 SLAs or MSAs communicating commitments to customers and internal/external users','Obtains Confidentiality Commitments from Vendors and Business Partners: The organization obtains confidentiality commitments that are consistent with the organization\'s confidentiality commitments and requirements from vendors and business partners who have access to confidential information.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:03',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:02','2026-07-27 23:40:02'),(267,4,1,221,'REQ000267','CC 9.2','REQ000267','The organization assesses and manages risks associated with vendors and business partners.\nThird-party attestation reports for all key vendors (SOC 2, ISO 27001, PCI DSS) and management reviews of the reports','Assesses Compliance With Confidentiality Commitments of Vendors and Business Partners: On a periodic and as-needed basis, the organization assesses compliance by vendors and business partners with the organization\'s confidentiality commitments and requirements.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:03',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:02','2026-07-27 23:40:02'),(268,4,1,222,'REQ000268','CC 9.2','REQ000268','The organization assesses and manages risks associated with vendors and business partners.\n5 SLAs or MSAs communicating commitments to customers and internal/external users','Obtains Privacy Commitments from Vendors and Business Partners: The organization obtains privacy commitments, consistent with the organization\'s privacy commitments and requirements, from vendors and business partners who have access to personal information.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:03',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:02','2026-07-27 23:40:03'),(269,4,1,223,'REQ000269','CC 9.2','REQ000269','The organization assesses and manages risks associated with vendors and business partners.\nThird-party attestation reports for all key vendors (SOC 2, ISO 27001, PCI DSS) and management reviews of the reports','Assesses Compliance with Privacy Commitments of Vendors and Business Partners: On a periodic and as-needed basis, the organization assesses compliance by vendors and business partners with the organization\'s privacy commitments and requirements and takes corrective action as necessary.','PENDING','PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-27 23:40:03',NULL,'PENDING',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'V1',0,5,5,'2026-07-27 23:40:03','2026-07-27 23:40:03');
